Package: local.apnsroute
Name: APNsRoute
Version: 1.2.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Requests endpoint retirement for matched connections after one shared two-second quiet period for VPN and Wi-Fi/cellular transitions without restarting apsd. Preserves native endpoint fallback and failure callbacks. Rootful iOS 14, automatically enabled on installation, with doctor diagnostics and no runtime logging.
Maintainer: Local Development
Author: Local Development
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0), firmware (<< 15.0), mobilesubstrate | com.ex.substitute
